Testing safe public wrapper functions with NULL checking
Testing NULL pointer safety:
mulle_mmap_sync(NULL) returned: -1 (expected: -1)
mulle_mmap_unmap(NULL) returned: -1 (expected: -1)
mulle_mmap_is_mapped(NULL) returned: 0 (expected: 0)
mulle_mmap_conditional_sync(NULL) returned: -1 (expected: -1)

Testing with valid uninitialized struct:
mulle_mmap_sync(&info) returned: -1 (expected: -1, unmapped)
mulle_mmap_is_mapped(&info) returned: 0 (expected: 0, not mapped)

All safe wrapper tests completed successfully.
